# Sensitive Data - Never commit
**/secrets.json
**/api-keys.json
**/tokens.txt
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/credentials.*

# Personal Notes - Optional exclusion
**/personal-notes.md
**/private-*.md

# Temporary Files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*~

# Large Context Files - Optionally exclude if too large
# Uncomment if session files become too large for git
# memory/sessions/*.md

# IDE and Editor Files
.DS_Store
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.sublime-*

# Generated Files
**/index.generated.json
**/*.cache
